  "provenance": "Synthetic, hand-labeled forgetting cases (spec §11.3 category 9). Each case seeds facts and episodes with ages and use history, runs one consolidation at now + advanceDays, and checks every row's resulting status ('deleted' when the row is gone) and, where given, the core profile. Deterministic; no provider.",
  "cases": [
